nemang eller engångsuttag. Avgiftens storlek varierar, men exempel är: 750 kr i administrativ avgift per beställning, 800 kr per timme för bearbetning."},"dct:identifier":"2021004888","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:lantmateriet@lm.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lantmäteriet"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.lantmateriet.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":{"@id":"https://resources.geodata.se/codelist/organisationer/lantmateriet"},"https://www.w3.org/ns/org#classification":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/orgAspects/feeFinanzing"}},{"@id":"https://www.geodata.se/resources/504ff5dc-192c-4fe2-b62e-395dd052206a","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"urn:uuid:36a8d012-e98d-59a5-1df2-d9e5e375b109"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"urn:uuid:a4ea78a9-e55f-b43f-b312-b1519213996c"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/OTHER"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Produkten innehåller kustlinje, sjöar/öar, vattendrag, riksgräns, länsgräns, polcirkeln och gradnät/rutnät."},"dct:identifier":"504ff5dc-192c-4fe2-b62e-395dd052206a","dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2012-01-01"},"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:54e22b907529eff3e2a2061a0aeeec4b79c795cfed1e1d39debc3fc4e5b08399_b0n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021004888"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:54e22b907529eff3e2a2061a0aeeec4b79c795cfed1e1d39debc3fc4e5b08399_b1n0"},"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:54e22b907529eff3e2a2061a0aeeec4b79c795cfed1e1d39debc3fc4e5b08399_b2n0"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"GSD-Sverigekartan 1:10 miljon vektor"}},{"@id":"urn:uuid:36a8d012-e98d-59a5-1df2-d9e5e375b109","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","